Concentration!

17
00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:45.976
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.026 --> 00:01:47.176
Caffeine!

19
00:01:48.277 --> 00:01:55.310
Did you know? Being very sleep-deprived can slow reaction times in a similar way to alcohol!

20
